--- Content for Baggage Policy ---
For domestic flights in Economy class you get 15 kg of free checked baggage (on most routes). In addition, you may bring one piece of cabin baggage weighing up to 7 kg (maximum dimensions 55 × 35 × 25 cm) plus a personal item such as a laptop or handbag.

--- Content for Pet Policy ---
Yes, pets are allowed on certain flights, subject to specific airline regulations and charges. Please contact customer support for more details regarding pet travel.

--- Content for Power Bank Policy ---
Power-banks are not allowed in checked baggage, but you may bring them in your cabin baggage (hand luggage). Just be sure to follow the DGCA’s rules on lithium-ion battery limits (e.g., capacity restrictions) and keep the power-bank with you in the cabin.
